    <briefdescription>
<para>Column-rule validation for a scout manifest <ndash/> the config rules and the toolchain column rule. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="struct_validator_1af387720572933d5519b0597814433c17" kindref="member">addRules()</ref> composes ConfigValidator&apos;s seven rules with one more rule: <computeroutput>toolchain</computeroutput> fails a <computeroutput>## toolchain</computeroutput> table whose header row declares no <computeroutput><ref refid="juce__UnityPluginInterface_8h_1a485dc2a0e5ed7da3d9f826367b36ee55a6440030ae8284cee96c1c88b356c45a7" kindref="member" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">command</ref></computeroutput> column or no <computeroutput>flag</computeroutput> column. <ref refid="struct_validator_1a394659562ffe86296738ed5a5b14f80f" kindref="member">getRules()</ref> returns the eight rules, built once. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
